1
00:00:01,001 --> 00:00:03,336
[theme music playing]

2
00:00:03,420 --> 00:00:06,464
[tense music playing]

3
00:00:20,353 --> 00:00:21,521
[screaming]

4
00:00:21,604 --> 00:00:23,773
[shattering sound]

5
00:00:27,902 --> 00:00:29,863
[Claire] <i>Emilia, what's going on?!</i>

6
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:33,283
[Emilia] <i>I'm tracking any possible</i>
<i>evidence against me.</i>

7
00:00:33,366 --> 00:00:35,994
<i>Ivy Aguas is back, Auntie!</i>

8
00:00:36,077 --> 00:00:39,330
[Ivy] <i>I'm here because I want</i>
<i>to keep an eye on you.</i>

9
00:00:39,414 --> 00:00:40,999
<i>Sleep well, Arnaldo.</i>

10
00:00:41,082 --> 00:00:43,752
-[Emilia] <i>Hi, Camia!</i>
<i>-What are you doing here?</i>

11
00:00:43,835 --> 00:00:45,670
<i>You went through my files at the capitol?!</i>

12
00:00:45,754 --> 00:00:47,297
<i>For what? To investigate me?</i>

13
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,133
<i>I won't let someone like you</i>
<i>put me behind bars!</i>

14
00:00:50,216 --> 00:00:51,426
<i>Do you understand?!</i>

15
00:00:51,509 --> 00:00:53,636
[Emilia] <i>Camia Cruz didn't</i>
<i>file the case against me?!</i>

16
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,346
<i>Who filed it?! Diego?!</i>

17
00:00:57,307 --> 00:00:59,434
<i>I can just imagine if this goes south.</i>

18
00:00:59,517 --> 00:01:02,145
<i>How will this affect your candidacy?</i>

19
00:01:02,228 --> 00:01:03,980
[Joselito] <i>Emilia will be tried</i>

20
00:01:04,064 --> 00:01:06,191
<i>because the evidence is strong</i>
<i>against her.</i>

21
00:01:06,274 --> 00:01:08,568
<i>You will lose a daughter.</i>
<i>She gives you nothing.</i>

22
00:01:08,651 --> 00:01:12,113
<i>In essence, you lose nothing.</i>
<i>Why will you kill for nothing?</i>

23
00:01:12,197 --> 00:01:13,573
[Ivy] <i>Thank you, Judge Nazareno.</i>

24
00:01:13,656 --> 00:01:16,159
<i>I believe in your cause</i>

25
00:01:16,242 --> 00:01:20,205
<i>and your desire to expose</i>
<i>corrupt public officials.</i>

26
00:01:20,288 --> 00:01:23,750
[Emilia] <i>Divine Oytengco</i>
<i>was seen with Diego Torillo!</i>

27
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,460
<i>Wait for them outside the restaurant</i>

28
00:01:25,543 --> 00:01:27,420
-<i>and blow their car into pieces!</i>
-[gunshot]

29
00:01:27,504 --> 00:01:29,464
<i>Make sure everyone is dead!</i>

30
00:01:29,714 --> 00:01:31,382
[Julio] <i>From the very start,</i>

31
00:01:31,800 --> 00:01:33,551
<i>there's only been one pest in this family!</i>

32
00:01:33,635 --> 00:01:34,636
<i>Diego Torillo!</i>

33
00:01:34,719 --> 00:01:37,472
[Diego] <i>Give us Emilia Ardiente-Torillo.</i>

34
00:01:37,555 --> 00:01:39,140
[police] <i>We have a warrant of arrest.</i>

35
00:01:39,224 --> 00:01:41,810
[Ivy] <i>As much as I'd like</i>
<i>to pity you, Emilia,</i>

36
00:01:41,893 --> 00:01:45,522
<i>I won't because you deserve</i>
<i>to be in prison.</i>

37
00:01:45,605 --> 00:01:47,106
<i>And I can't even celebrate</i>

38
00:01:47,190 --> 00:01:50,902
<i>because seeking justice is not a game,</i>

39
00:01:50,985 --> 00:01:52,862
<i>it's a responsibility.</i>

40
00:01:52,946 --> 00:01:55,740
[tense music continues]

41
00:02:06,251 --> 00:02:07,460
Ardiente, you have a visitor.

42
00:02:16,594 --> 00:02:17,804
Wow.

43
00:02:19,097 --> 00:02:22,016
Look what the cat dragged in.

44
00:02:24,060 --> 00:02:26,563
You look at home in here.

45
00:02:29,566 --> 00:02:31,359
Really, Ivy? Come on.

46
00:02:32,068 --> 00:02:34,279
You're actually making
fun of someone in jail?

47
00:02:34,779 --> 00:02:38,491
Is that how low you can be?
Come on, give me a break.

48
00:02:38,575 --> 00:02:39,951
What do you expect, Emilia?

49
00:02:40,869 --> 00:02:44,330
You think I'd stop
just because you're in prison?

50
00:02:44,747 --> 00:02:47,709
No way! It can't be.

51
00:02:47,792 --> 00:02:49,711
This is the real nature
of our relationship.

52
00:02:49,794 --> 00:02:51,504
We are forever like this.

53
00:02:51,588 --> 00:02:52,672
[Emilia] How dare you!

54
00:02:53,298 --> 00:02:55,633
-How dare you!
-[Ivy] Hey! Calm down!

55
00:02:57,260 --> 00:02:58,636
Have you forgotten?

56
00:02:59,262 --> 00:03:01,931
Remember, you once told me

57
00:03:02,015 --> 00:03:05,184
while you were drunk at your rest house

58
00:03:05,810 --> 00:03:08,104
that when you were still
the mayor, governor,

59
00:03:08,187 --> 00:03:10,356
and queen of Poblacion Ardiente,

60
00:03:10,648 --> 00:03:15,278
you were stealing millions
of government funds.

61
00:03:15,528 --> 00:03:21,200
Now, you are dubbed
as "Emilia, the Corrupt Queen."

62
00:03:23,536 --> 00:03:27,081
[Emilia] <i>Politics is something</i>
<i>beyond what you can imagine.</i>

63
00:03:27,165 --> 00:03:28,791
<i>It has its own perks.</i>

64
00:03:28,875 --> 00:03:31,127
<i>And you can actually steal</i>
<i>billions of money.</i>

65
00:03:31,210 --> 00:03:32,921
-[Emilia laughing]
-<i>Billions?</i>

66
00:03:33,004 --> 00:03:35,048
<i>That's supposed to be a secret, okay?</i>

67
00:03:40,303 --> 00:03:42,472
You filthy witch!

68
00:03:42,555 --> 00:03:45,141
You ratted me out! Shame on you!

69
00:03:45,225 --> 00:03:47,268
You filthy animal! It's you!

70
00:03:47,352 --> 00:03:49,520
You colluded with Diego Torillo!

71
00:03:49,938 --> 00:03:51,064
I knew it!

72
00:03:53,942 --> 00:03:56,027
[Claire] Julio, please talk to me!

73
00:03:56,110 --> 00:03:57,946
They've imprisoned your daughter!

74
00:03:58,029 --> 00:04:00,156
You should see her situation now!

75
00:04:00,615 --> 00:04:01,658
[thuds loudly]

76
00:04:02,909 --> 00:04:04,244
What do you want me to do?

77
00:04:04,327 --> 00:04:06,579
Get her a high-caliber lawyer!

78
00:04:07,330 --> 00:04:09,707
Emilia's case must be dismissed!

79
00:04:10,166 --> 00:04:14,045
You're asking me to go against the law?

80
00:04:15,338 --> 00:04:18,216
I have an election to win!

81
00:04:18,675 --> 00:04:20,093
What will the people say

82
00:04:20,176 --> 00:04:22,595
if I release my criminal daughter?!

83
00:04:22,679 --> 00:04:23,805
[laughs]

84
00:04:24,639 --> 00:04:28,059
-So now, you follow the law?
-Yes.

85
00:04:28,977 --> 00:04:30,561
I may not be an Ardiente,

86
00:04:30,979 --> 00:04:34,440
but I know all the monstrosities
of this family!

87
00:04:34,816 --> 00:04:39,279
And none of those deeds
are punished by law!

88
00:04:39,445 --> 00:04:41,572
You know that you can release Emilia.

89
00:04:42,031 --> 00:04:44,158
Why, Julio?!
Why aren't you doing anything?

90
00:04:44,242 --> 00:04:45,868
Why are you punishing your own daughter?!

91
00:04:45,952 --> 00:04:47,203
Just shut up!

92
00:04:48,204 --> 00:04:50,790
Who do you think you are, Claire?! Huh?

93
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:55,003
You're nothing
but Emilia's glorified help!

94
00:04:55,086 --> 00:04:56,546
And now that she's gone,

95
00:04:56,629 --> 00:04:58,756
you have no place in this household!

96
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:00,758
You better learn your place!

97
00:05:01,759 --> 00:05:04,262
Yes! I know, I don't belong here!

98
00:05:04,971 --> 00:05:08,141
I know your family is a bunch
of heartless criminals!

99
00:05:08,224 --> 00:05:11,394
And I'm only here for Emilia!

100
00:05:11,477 --> 00:05:14,230
If it weren't for her,
I already left this hellhole!

101
00:05:15,148 --> 00:05:16,149
Remember this!

102
00:05:16,232 --> 00:05:18,026
Remember this well, Julio!

103
00:05:19,527 --> 00:05:22,613
The day will come
when you'll meet your demise!

104
00:05:24,866 --> 00:05:27,285
Now that Arnaldo is in a coma

105
00:05:28,161 --> 00:05:29,829
and Emilia in jail,

106
00:05:29,912 --> 00:05:31,414
you're all alone.

107
00:05:31,497 --> 00:05:33,750
You're going to die alone!

108
00:05:34,584 --> 00:05:36,002
[tense music playing]

109
00:05:36,085 --> 00:05:37,670
No one will remember you!

110
00:05:37,754 --> 00:05:39,881
Even the town that is named after you

111
00:05:39,964 --> 00:05:41,883
will forget you!

112
00:05:51,684 --> 00:05:54,353
Dying is the furthest thing from my mind!

113
00:05:55,980 --> 00:05:57,899
I've got too many things to do.

114
00:05:59,442 --> 00:06:00,443
[sighs]

115
00:06:11,037 --> 00:06:14,123
You freaking witch! I am so done with you!

116
00:06:14,207 --> 00:06:16,751
Filthy witch! What's this for, huh?!

117
00:06:16,834 --> 00:06:19,170
A box of charity?! I don't need that!

118
00:06:19,253 --> 00:06:20,546
I don't need any of these!

119
00:06:20,630 --> 00:06:23,591
I don't need your clothes!
I don't need your stuff!

120
00:06:23,674 --> 00:06:27,345
[Emilia panting softly]

121
00:06:27,428 --> 00:06:29,430
[laughing]

122
00:06:34,977 --> 00:06:37,105
Well, Emilia, there's nothing I can do

123
00:06:37,188 --> 00:06:40,775
if you suspect me
of putting you behind bars.

124
00:06:41,984 --> 00:06:47,031
Actually, maybe you are destined
to be in jail!

125
00:06:47,532 --> 00:06:49,158
Does it hurt, Emilia?

126
00:06:49,575 --> 00:06:53,121
Well, it's exactly what you deserve.

127
00:06:53,955 --> 00:06:54,956
You witch!

128
00:06:56,499 --> 00:06:59,460
You'll pay for this! You'll pay for this!

129
00:06:59,961 --> 00:07:02,296
You filthy witch, Ivy!

130
00:07:02,922 --> 00:07:04,882
Yes, I am.

131
00:07:07,468 --> 00:07:10,054
Well, anyway, will you be all right?

132
00:07:10,304 --> 00:07:11,931
You better relax, okay?

133
00:07:12,682 --> 00:07:13,975
Bye, Corruption Queen!

134
00:07:14,434 --> 00:07:17,019
[screaming and grunting]

135
00:07:17,103 --> 00:07:20,106
[chuckling]

136
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:23,025
-[laughing]
-[grunting]

137
00:07:23,818 --> 00:07:26,028
[Emilia screaming]

138
00:07:26,404 --> 00:07:29,073
-No, those are for you!
-[Emilia screaming]

139
00:07:29,157 --> 00:07:30,199
Get her out!

140
00:07:30,575 --> 00:07:31,617
[chuckling]

141
00:07:31,868 --> 00:07:33,703
Bye, Corruption Queen!

142
00:07:34,704 --> 00:07:35,830
Snake!

143
00:07:36,914 --> 00:07:38,332
[tense music playing]

144
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:42,044
[whimpering]

145
00:07:42,128 --> 00:07:45,590
-Why am I here?
-[whimpering]

146
00:07:47,258 --> 00:07:50,887
[medical equipment beeping]

147
00:07:55,433 --> 00:07:57,768
Could you leave us for a moment?

148
00:07:57,852 --> 00:07:59,770
I will just call you if I need you.

149
00:07:59,854 --> 00:08:00,855
Noted, sir.

150
00:08:12,617 --> 00:08:13,826
[pensive music playing]

151
00:08:14,619 --> 00:08:16,037
[Claire] <i>You will be left alone!</i>

152
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:17,872
<i>You're going to die alone!</i>

153
00:08:17,955 --> 00:08:19,457
<i>No one will remember you!</i>

154
00:08:19,540 --> 00:08:21,626
<i>Even the town that is named after you</i>

155
00:08:21,709 --> 00:08:23,878
<i>will forget you!</i>

156
00:08:26,631 --> 00:08:28,424
Wake up, Arnaldo.

157
00:08:29,967 --> 00:08:31,177
You have to wake up.

158
00:08:32,178 --> 00:08:34,180
You are an Ardiente.

159
00:08:35,264 --> 00:08:40,353
And I do not allow you
nor give you the right to die.

160
00:08:41,479 --> 00:08:42,772
You can't die.

161
00:08:47,443 --> 00:08:49,529
What is happening to us?

162
00:08:50,363 --> 00:08:52,573
My grandson in a coma,

163
00:08:53,866 --> 00:08:56,118
my daughter in jail…

164
00:09:00,873 --> 00:09:03,251
What's left in me

165
00:09:05,044 --> 00:09:07,338
is being taken away by my enemies.

166
00:09:09,549 --> 00:09:10,716
This cannot be.

167
00:09:14,178 --> 00:09:16,764
I will defend our name!

168
00:09:18,558 --> 00:09:19,976
I will protect

169
00:09:22,562 --> 00:09:24,772
the family of Ardientes!

170
00:09:25,940 --> 00:09:28,568
I'll come up with a plan
before all is lost.

171
00:09:30,236 --> 00:09:33,656
The Ardiente family and Ardiente name…

172
00:09:34,949 --> 00:09:36,492
shall never fall!

173
00:09:38,286 --> 00:09:39,912
I will not allow it.

174
00:09:43,916 --> 00:09:45,918
[slow tense music playing]

175
00:10:03,185 --> 00:10:05,104
[voice prompt] <i>The subscriber</i>
<i>cannot be reached.</i>

176
00:10:05,187 --> 00:10:06,230
<i>Please try again--</i>

177
00:10:16,407 --> 00:10:18,284
<i>The subscriber cannot be reached.</i>

178
00:10:18,367 --> 00:10:19,952
<i>Please try again later.</i>

179
00:10:27,960 --> 00:10:28,961
Hey, you!

180
00:10:29,795 --> 00:10:31,672
You! I need your phone!

181
00:10:31,964 --> 00:10:33,049
I need to call somebody.

182
00:10:33,132 --> 00:10:36,719
I'm sorry, ma'am, but the time
for phone calls is over.

183
00:10:36,802 --> 00:10:37,970
What?!

184
00:10:38,054 --> 00:10:40,681
Just lend me your phone.
It'll only take a minute.

185
00:10:40,765 --> 00:10:41,974
I'm really sorry.

186
00:10:45,227 --> 00:10:46,228
[grunting]

187
00:10:48,314 --> 00:10:52,693
You good-for-nothing boy scout!

188
00:10:53,110 --> 00:10:54,612
Open the cell and get out of my way!

189
00:10:57,114 --> 00:10:59,325
-Papa!
-Yes.

190
00:10:59,825 --> 00:11:02,370
Yes, my beautiful daughter. I'm here.

191
00:11:03,621 --> 00:11:05,331
I'm so glad you came.

192
00:11:05,831 --> 00:11:08,000
So, are you gonna
take me out of this limbo?

193
00:11:10,086 --> 00:11:10,961
No.

194
00:11:12,838 --> 00:11:13,798
What?!

195
00:11:14,215 --> 00:11:17,259
I can't let you out. I mean, look at you.

196
00:11:17,635 --> 00:11:21,639
You're all miserable and desperate.

197
00:11:21,972 --> 00:11:24,183
Give me one good reason
why I should let you out.

198
00:11:24,475 --> 00:11:26,143
Because I am your daughter!

199
00:11:27,311 --> 00:11:30,189
That is not a good enough reason.

200
00:11:31,232 --> 00:11:32,566
You know what, Emilia?

201
00:11:32,650 --> 00:11:36,862
I was thinking,
you should take time to relax.

202
00:11:37,321 --> 00:11:38,572
You know… Uh…

203
00:11:38,989 --> 00:11:44,495
Take this opportunity
to assess your past actions.

204
00:11:44,578 --> 00:11:48,082
And you can do it all
in the comfort of this jail.

205
00:11:48,833 --> 00:11:51,460
As I was looking around coming in here,

206
00:11:52,878 --> 00:11:56,173
taking it all in,
it's not a really that bad a place.

207
00:11:56,841 --> 00:11:58,759
And one more thing.

208
00:11:59,969 --> 00:12:03,264
Why would I help you
if you do nothing for me?

209
00:12:03,347 --> 00:12:05,266
You're useless to me right now.

210
00:12:05,349 --> 00:12:08,769
You might even do something worse

211
00:12:08,853 --> 00:12:11,272
that will complicate my candidacy.

212
00:12:11,939 --> 00:12:14,400
[sobs] You cannot abandon me, Papa!

213
00:12:14,483 --> 00:12:15,985
You cannot!

214
00:12:16,068 --> 00:12:17,820
Believe me, Emilia,

215
00:12:18,821 --> 00:12:21,991
this is for our family's best interest.

216
00:12:22,074 --> 00:12:24,493
But, Papa, I need to get out from here!

217
00:12:24,577 --> 00:12:26,078
I need to win this case.

218
00:12:26,162 --> 00:12:28,164
Please, Papa! Help me!

219
00:12:28,247 --> 00:12:32,543
I'm sorry. Goodbye, my dear.

220
00:12:32,626 --> 00:12:35,254
Papa! Please!

221
00:12:36,130 --> 00:12:37,465
Papa!

222
00:12:38,757 --> 00:12:40,759
Why are you doing this to me?!

223
00:12:41,844 --> 00:12:44,680
All my life, you're doing this to me!

224
00:12:45,222 --> 00:12:47,808
Why is it so difficult
for you to save me?!

225
00:12:48,851 --> 00:12:52,354
Why is it so difficult
for you to love me, Papa?!

226
00:12:53,063 --> 00:12:56,692
What did I do
for you to treat me like this?!

227
00:12:58,652 --> 00:13:01,405
You should have just killed me, Papa!

228
00:13:01,489 --> 00:13:07,077
You should never have let me live
if you were just going to abandon me!

229
00:13:07,161 --> 00:13:10,372
You've never done anything
but insult me and hurt me!

230
00:13:10,456 --> 00:13:14,418
You should have just killed me!
You're a useless father!

231
00:13:16,962 --> 00:13:18,672
[tense music playing]

232
00:13:18,756 --> 00:13:21,634
Papa! [whimpering]

233
00:13:23,260 --> 00:13:26,388
Please! Papa!

234
00:13:29,850 --> 00:13:31,310
Papa!

235
00:13:32,186 --> 00:13:33,187
Hey!

236
00:13:35,940 --> 00:13:37,608
Remember this.

237
00:13:39,068 --> 00:13:41,111
My daughter is in there.

238
00:13:42,947 --> 00:13:45,741
Give her everything she wants.

239
00:13:47,493 --> 00:13:50,871
I don't ever want to hear
that my daughter has been hurt.

240
00:13:51,455 --> 00:13:53,958
Don't let anyone lay a finger on her.

241
00:13:58,003 --> 00:13:59,880
[tense music playing]

242
00:14:06,053 --> 00:14:08,055
[Ivy] Out of 18 villages,

243
00:14:08,138 --> 00:14:11,183
ten are solid Ardiente supporters.

244
00:14:11,850 --> 00:14:13,185
That's quite a lead.

245
00:14:14,019 --> 00:14:15,187
You know, Ivy,

246
00:14:15,646 --> 00:14:20,484
I will surely win if you help me.

247
00:14:21,694 --> 00:14:23,863
Fifty million pesos.

248
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:28,784
That's all I need right now
to tip the scale to my favor.

249
00:14:28,868 --> 00:14:32,246
The campaign period is over, Congressman?

250
00:14:32,663 --> 00:14:34,290
Why do you need money?

251
00:14:34,874 --> 00:14:40,629
Well, unless you're talking
about vote buying,

252
00:14:41,297 --> 00:14:44,508
If that's what it takes
to paint the town red,

253
00:14:45,426 --> 00:14:46,468
so be it.

254
00:14:46,969 --> 00:14:50,848
If I help you, what will I get in return?

255
00:14:53,267 --> 00:14:56,270
Arnaldo is in a coma. Emilia is in jail.

256
00:14:57,563 --> 00:15:00,399
That leaves you and me.

257
00:15:01,901 --> 00:15:03,569
I will become king

258
00:15:04,612 --> 00:15:08,782
and you will be queen
of Poblacion Ardiente.

259
00:15:09,867 --> 00:15:10,951
[chuckles]

260
00:15:12,578 --> 00:15:18,626
Julio Ardiente is willing
to share the throne?

261
00:15:19,960 --> 00:15:23,130
Now that I'm all alone in this fight,

262
00:15:23,923 --> 00:15:27,676
I need to be sure of everyone's loyalty.

263
00:15:28,469 --> 00:15:32,431
Ivy, I will weed out
all the bad grass and flowers,

264
00:15:32,514 --> 00:15:35,017
those who wish to go against my reign.

265
00:15:35,559 --> 00:15:37,978
Now, give it to me straight.

266
00:15:38,771 --> 00:15:41,357
Are you going to accept my offer?

267
00:15:46,028 --> 00:15:50,449
It's either you're with me
or you're against me.

268
00:15:50,866 --> 00:15:52,326
[music intensifies]

269
00:15:55,412 --> 00:15:57,331
[foreboding music playing]

270
00:16:04,213 --> 00:16:06,215
[suspenseful music playing]

271
00:16:19,770 --> 00:16:22,064
[Ivy] <i>Obviously, this question is a trap.</i>

272
00:16:22,147 --> 00:16:25,693
<i>Do you think an old man like you</i>
<i>can fool me?</i>

273
00:16:29,446 --> 00:16:33,033
Congressman, my loyalty belongs to you.

274
00:16:33,450 --> 00:16:34,702
It's all yours.

275
00:16:35,494 --> 00:16:36,704
You are my governor

276
00:16:36,787 --> 00:16:41,250
and you will surely win the election.

277
00:16:41,542 --> 00:16:45,879
My, my, what an intricate web you spin.

278
00:16:46,922 --> 00:16:51,427
Come into my parlor,
said the spider to the fly.

279
00:17:01,353 --> 00:17:02,938
That Julio is despicable!

280
00:17:03,689 --> 00:17:07,484
<i>Ivy, don't let the Ardientes</i>
<i>use your money.</i>

281
00:17:07,776 --> 00:17:08,736
[Ivy] <i>Of course, not.</i>

282
00:17:08,819 --> 00:17:12,573
I only said that
to convince him of my loyalty.

283
00:17:12,656 --> 00:17:17,786
But I will never agree to fund
his election scheme.

284
00:17:18,203 --> 00:17:21,415
Well then, tell me the time and location,

285
00:17:21,707 --> 00:17:24,001
I'll go there and take your money back.

286
00:17:27,212 --> 00:17:29,214
[tense music playing]

287
00:17:36,138 --> 00:17:37,806
-[woman] Good morning, Miss Ivy.
-Good morning.

288
00:17:41,143 --> 00:17:42,978
-[woman] Good morning, ma'am.
-Good morning.

289
00:17:46,648 --> 00:17:47,733
Good morning.

290
00:17:51,111 --> 00:17:52,696
Gather everyone in the boardroom.

291
00:17:52,780 --> 00:17:54,031
-Yes, ma'am.
-Now.

292
00:17:54,114 --> 00:17:55,491
[Mr. Feliciano] Let me start, Miss Aguas.

293
00:17:56,200 --> 00:18:00,788
Fifty million pesos is a lot of money
for additional marketing budget.

294
00:18:00,871 --> 00:18:06,335
Mr. Feliciano, as 70-percent
owner of Aguas Realties,

295
00:18:06,418 --> 00:18:11,882
I have the right to allocate
the budget to a worthy cause.

296
00:18:12,966 --> 00:18:16,220
And besides, this won't even offset

297
00:18:16,720 --> 00:18:18,055
the amount of money

298
00:18:18,388 --> 00:18:21,266
that my investors brought in, remember?

299
00:18:21,975 --> 00:18:23,602
[Mr. Castro] That's right, Mr. Feliciano.

300
00:18:24,228 --> 00:18:25,646
Poblacion Ardiente

301
00:18:25,979 --> 00:18:28,357
is a passion project of Miss Aguas.

302
00:18:28,857 --> 00:18:31,443
It has potential for greater revenue.

303
00:18:31,944 --> 00:18:35,155
But this is too much to risk!
Can't you see it?

304
00:18:35,239 --> 00:18:37,366
[board members chattering]

305
00:18:38,325 --> 00:18:39,326
Okay.

306
00:18:40,160 --> 00:18:45,958
Maybe we should just vote on it?

307
00:18:48,544 --> 00:18:51,296
All those in favor of my proposal,

308
00:18:51,964 --> 00:18:53,549
you can raise your hands.

309
00:19:10,649 --> 00:19:11,859
Well, I guess,

310
00:19:12,109 --> 00:19:16,530
this matter is already settled,
Mr. Feliciano.

311
00:19:18,198 --> 00:19:19,158
And one more thing,

312
00:19:19,241 --> 00:19:21,994
I've decided to take an indefinite leave

313
00:19:22,536 --> 00:19:24,705
because of pressing issues, Mr. Castro,

314
00:19:24,788 --> 00:19:29,251
so I appoint you as OIC of Aguas Realties.

315
00:19:31,295 --> 00:19:33,630
The board has already decided on this,

316
00:19:33,714 --> 00:19:37,759
so I want you to report
everything company details.

317
00:19:37,843 --> 00:19:42,181
And I expect the same loyalty
that you gave to Miss Prianka.

318
00:19:42,806 --> 00:19:43,974
Of course, Miss Aguas.

319
00:19:45,058 --> 00:19:46,935
But if you don't mind me asking,

320
00:19:47,352 --> 00:19:50,772
how long will your project
in Poblacion Ardiente last?

321
00:19:50,856 --> 00:19:53,984
Because frankly, it's taking so much time.

322
00:19:54,943 --> 00:19:58,030
A few months more
and everything will be complete

323
00:19:59,156 --> 00:20:01,408
as exactly planned.

324
00:20:09,166 --> 00:20:11,460
-Emilia.
-[Emilia] Papa is so heartless!

325
00:20:11,543 --> 00:20:12,669
He's a monster!

326
00:20:12,753 --> 00:20:15,088
He left me here to die!
He said he won't help me!

327
00:20:15,172 --> 00:20:17,883
<i>And without Papa's help,</i>
<i>I will rot in here!</i>

328
00:20:17,966 --> 00:20:19,801
And I don't want that to happen!

329
00:20:20,510 --> 00:20:22,179
[Raul] Don't worry. I'll help you.

330
00:20:22,638 --> 00:20:23,597
[Emilia] <i>Please, Jaguar.</i>

331
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,891
Please help me.

332
00:20:26,558 --> 00:20:28,477
I'll help you but on one condition.

333
00:20:29,102 --> 00:20:30,437
<i>From now on, you'll be mine</i>

334
00:20:30,520 --> 00:20:32,439
and you'll turn your back on your father.

335
00:20:33,523 --> 00:20:36,860
We'll work together
to bring Julio Ardiente down.

336
00:20:37,819 --> 00:20:40,656
I'll do anything just get me out of here!

337
00:20:40,739 --> 00:20:43,242
I'll even turn my back
on my worthless father!

338
00:20:49,164 --> 00:20:51,291
Get ready. We have a job to do.

339
00:20:51,959 --> 00:20:53,794
Are we going to track down Madrigal?

340
00:20:54,711 --> 00:20:55,712
No.

341
00:20:55,796 --> 00:20:57,547
It's a new mission for us.

342
00:20:58,966 --> 00:21:00,884
But some of you must stay here.

343
00:21:01,843 --> 00:21:04,096
We need to be careful
'cause we're still on the radar.

344
00:21:04,888 --> 00:21:05,973
Understood, boss.

345
00:21:17,609 --> 00:21:19,945
[Ivy] Fifty million, as promised.

346
00:21:20,529 --> 00:21:21,947
Impressive.

347
00:21:24,366 --> 00:21:26,618
-Would you like to count it?
-Nah.

348
00:21:27,202 --> 00:21:28,203
I trust you.

349
00:21:31,081 --> 00:21:32,165
[thuds loudly]

350
00:21:32,833 --> 00:21:34,626
Not so fast, Congressman.

351
00:21:36,169 --> 00:21:38,755
I want to know where my money is going.

352
00:21:39,631 --> 00:21:41,258
Do you really wanna know?

353
00:21:42,592 --> 00:21:44,761
It's a task for my goons.

354
00:21:46,763 --> 00:21:50,642
Don't worry, Col. Sanggano is my watchdog.

355
00:21:51,893 --> 00:21:54,563
Besides, I can also endorse
your campaign, right?

356
00:21:55,647 --> 00:21:58,150
Surely, they can't say no
to a beautiful woman.

357
00:22:02,738 --> 00:22:04,740
[tense music playing]

358
00:22:09,494 --> 00:22:12,080
[Damian] It was a fist fight,
but he shot me!

359
00:22:12,956 --> 00:22:14,833
That filthy animal!

360
00:22:15,709 --> 00:22:17,836
Raul, you're going to pay for this!

361
00:22:20,797 --> 00:22:23,800
Boss, what about our pay?

362
00:22:26,845 --> 00:22:31,349
Who were the idiots
that lost to Raul's men?!

363
00:22:31,975 --> 00:22:35,020
-It's all of you, right?!
-Just kidding, boss.

364
00:22:35,937 --> 00:22:36,980
A joke?

365
00:22:37,814 --> 00:22:39,524
Do I look like I'm kidding?!

366
00:22:40,108 --> 00:22:41,943
Do you think this is a comedy bar?!

367
00:22:43,278 --> 00:22:47,407
Hey, you stand up!
Who told you to sit down?!

368
00:22:51,620 --> 00:22:53,288
But you have a point, Panganiban.

369
00:22:54,331 --> 00:22:59,419
We need to get back on Raul
for what he stole from me!

370
00:23:00,545 --> 00:23:02,047
We'll drain his wealth!

371
00:23:04,174 --> 00:23:05,801
What are you waiting for?!

372
00:23:06,510 --> 00:23:09,179
-Move out! Now!
-[Panganiban] Yes, boss.

373
00:23:11,723 --> 00:23:14,351
[groaning loudly]

374
00:23:14,810 --> 00:23:17,062
Panganiban! Get me some painkillers!

375
00:23:17,938 --> 00:23:19,940
[police] This man was caught for robbery.

376
00:23:22,025 --> 00:23:23,735
[ominous music playing]

377
00:23:28,156 --> 00:23:29,241
[thumps]

378
00:23:35,080 --> 00:23:38,542
-Did you see those guys?
-[police] No, who are they?

379
00:23:39,960 --> 00:23:42,337
-They look new here.
-Let's check on them.

380
00:23:43,880 --> 00:23:45,715
[suspenseful music playing]

381
00:23:51,513 --> 00:23:52,556
Who are you two?

382
00:23:53,223 --> 00:23:54,182
-[thumps]
-[grunts loudly]

383
00:23:54,266 --> 00:23:55,225
[henchman] Where's the key?

384
00:23:55,934 --> 00:23:57,602
-Open the cell!
-[Emilia] What's going on?!

385
00:24:00,522 --> 00:24:01,481
What's going on?!

386
00:24:04,943 --> 00:24:06,653
-[thumps]
-[Emilia screams]

387
00:24:07,070 --> 00:24:09,030
[henchman] Ma'am Emilia,
Jaguar ordered us to get you.

388
00:24:09,614 --> 00:24:10,574
Let's go.

389
00:24:11,324 --> 00:24:12,492
-Ma'am Emilia!
-[Emilia screams]

390
00:24:12,868 --> 00:24:14,202
[gunshots]

391
00:24:16,663 --> 00:24:17,581
[woman screaming]

392
00:24:18,623 --> 00:24:19,958
[gunshots]

393
00:24:21,209 --> 00:24:22,586
[gunshots]

394
00:24:23,128 --> 00:24:24,880
-[gunshots]
-[Emilia screams]

395
00:24:24,963 --> 00:24:25,964
Come on.

396
00:24:26,798 --> 00:24:27,674
Oh my God!

397
00:24:33,305 --> 00:24:34,723
[henchman 1] It's Boss Jaguar.

398
00:24:40,770 --> 00:24:42,105
-[henchman 2] Boss Jaguar.
-Boss.

399
00:24:42,189 --> 00:24:43,231
Jaguar.

400
00:24:47,485 --> 00:24:52,115
[action music playing]

401
00:24:52,365 --> 00:24:53,366
[gunshots]

402
00:25:09,883 --> 00:25:11,843
[tires screeching]

403
00:25:11,927 --> 00:25:13,053
[Ivy] Yes, Congressman.

404
00:25:13,637 --> 00:25:15,513
I'm with Sanggano

405
00:25:15,805 --> 00:25:18,183
and we're on our way to the village chiefs

406
00:25:18,266 --> 00:25:20,727
to deliver the money.

407
00:25:23,605 --> 00:25:24,689
[Ivy] <i>Yes, Congressman.</i>

408
00:25:25,607 --> 00:25:26,566
Thank you.

409
00:25:34,699 --> 00:25:38,453
As early as now,
I'd like to thank everyone

410
00:25:39,454 --> 00:25:43,333
for your help in preventing
Julio's election scheme.

411
00:25:43,416 --> 00:25:46,002
How sure are you
that there will be a vote-buying

412
00:25:46,086 --> 00:25:48,630
between Julio and the village chiefs?

413
00:25:48,964 --> 00:25:51,800
I have a credible source,
and I'm sure of it.

414
00:25:51,883 --> 00:25:56,054
The people of Balete and San Narciso
became the bulwarks of Ardiente

415
00:25:56,137 --> 00:25:58,974
because they already sold off their votes.

416
00:26:00,183 --> 00:26:02,602
[Diego] That's why we need to catch them.

417
00:26:06,898 --> 00:26:09,943
[tense music playing]

418
00:26:11,403 --> 00:26:12,737
We are being followed.

419
00:26:17,450 --> 00:26:19,828
-Who?
-Diego Torillo.

420
00:26:28,670 --> 00:26:29,754
Let's do this.

421
00:26:41,725 --> 00:26:43,768
-[Ivy] My God!
-[tires screeching]

422
00:26:48,106 --> 00:26:48,982
[Fernan] Get down!

423
00:26:49,065 --> 00:26:50,692
[Ivy] Oh my God! Sanggano!

424
00:26:52,569 --> 00:26:53,653
[Ivy] What's going on?!

425
00:26:55,989 --> 00:26:57,157
[man] Get down!

426
00:27:01,077 --> 00:27:02,203
What's the matter?

427
00:27:02,495 --> 00:27:04,622
Someone told us that you have money

428
00:27:05,123 --> 00:27:07,959
to bribe village captains
for the election!

429
00:27:08,293 --> 00:27:09,252
Stay out of this!

430
00:27:09,669 --> 00:27:12,172
You're not a cop, so you can't arrest us!

431
00:27:12,255 --> 00:27:13,882
-Put that down!
-We've got you surrounded!

432
00:27:13,965 --> 00:27:16,009
You put that down now!

433
00:27:16,092 --> 00:27:19,512
Come on, Sanggano! Do something!

434
00:27:21,973 --> 00:27:23,975
[tense music playing]

435
00:27:29,939 --> 00:27:31,358
Excuse me, Diego Torillo!

436
00:27:34,778 --> 00:27:36,738
Don't you dare lay a hand on this money!

437
00:27:38,114 --> 00:27:39,157
Sanggano!

438
00:27:40,408 --> 00:27:42,869
Hands off me! Get off!

439
00:27:42,952 --> 00:27:44,245
-[grunts]
-[man] Diego!

440
00:27:44,329 --> 00:27:47,123
[both grunting]

441
00:27:47,540 --> 00:27:48,583
[gunshot]

442
00:27:54,714 --> 00:27:55,799
[thumps]

443
00:28:10,647 --> 00:28:11,606
Sanggano!

444
00:28:14,442 --> 00:28:15,777
Go away, Diego!

445
00:28:16,486 --> 00:28:18,696
Don't you dare touch my money!

446
00:28:18,780 --> 00:28:20,740
Hands off! It's mine!

447
00:28:22,951 --> 00:28:24,452
[Diego] Come on, let's go! Let's go!

448
00:28:25,161 --> 00:28:26,246
That's my money!

449
00:28:26,704 --> 00:28:28,081
-[Diego] Let's go!
-[man] Hurry!

450
00:28:29,666 --> 00:28:32,043
[Ivy] Hey! You thieves!

451
00:28:32,460 --> 00:28:35,588
That's my money! Thieves!

452
00:28:35,964 --> 00:28:38,049
Get up! You're all worthless!

453
00:28:44,013 --> 00:28:47,809
[Ivy] <i>There's no way in hell</i>
<i>that you'll exploit my money,</i>

454
00:28:48,226 --> 00:28:49,602
<i>old man Julio.</i>

455
00:28:54,315 --> 00:28:56,818
[woman] Anna, I need to see Miss Camia!

456
00:28:56,901 --> 00:28:57,944
[Anna] She's here.

457
00:28:58,027 --> 00:28:59,779
-Auntie.
-[woman] Miss Camia!

458
00:28:59,863 --> 00:29:02,240
Ivy and Diego were involved
in an encounter!

459
00:29:02,323 --> 00:29:03,575
-[Anna] Huh?
-What?!

460
00:29:04,492 --> 00:29:06,494
My goodness, what happened this time?!

461
00:29:06,786 --> 00:29:10,039
-Anna, we need to contact Jepoy!
-Go ahead, Auntie.

462
00:29:12,500 --> 00:29:14,502
[slow tense music playing]

463
00:29:16,087 --> 00:29:20,383
Hey! Madrigal! No, no, no!

464
00:29:21,593 --> 00:29:23,887
I asked you!
Where the hell are you going?!

465
00:29:23,970 --> 00:29:27,182
You can't leave!
You still owe me for saving you!

466
00:29:27,265 --> 00:29:29,851
Ma'am, I have to go. Please.

467
00:29:29,934 --> 00:29:34,105
[scoffs] Where are you going?
Who will you save this time?

468
00:29:34,606 --> 00:29:35,815
Is it Diego?

469
00:29:36,357 --> 00:29:37,776
Or Camia Cruz?

470
00:29:37,859 --> 00:29:40,570
Or Lily Cruz?

471
00:29:41,488 --> 00:29:43,740
Who the hell is that girl?!

472
00:29:45,617 --> 00:29:47,368
Is she the savior of this town?!

473
00:29:47,452 --> 00:29:49,913
Ma'am, I know and I will never forget

474
00:29:49,996 --> 00:29:51,247
that I owe you my life.

475
00:29:51,331 --> 00:29:52,999
I always pay my debts!

476
00:29:54,042 --> 00:29:55,960
But just this once, ma'am,
please let me go.

477
00:29:57,045 --> 00:29:58,046
Please.

478
00:30:02,509 --> 00:30:03,384
Okay.

479
00:30:10,600 --> 00:30:12,519
[Ivy] Hey, Col. Sanggano! Wake up!

480
00:30:13,269 --> 00:30:16,147
You're pretty useless for a colonel!

481
00:30:17,941 --> 00:30:19,651
[Sanggano] Where's Diego?!

482
00:30:19,734 --> 00:30:21,402
-Where is he?!
-Where do you think?!

483
00:30:21,486 --> 00:30:22,737
He's gone now!

484
00:30:22,821 --> 00:30:24,280
Gone with my money!

485
00:30:25,281 --> 00:30:26,825
We need to go after that bastard!

486
00:30:26,908 --> 00:30:28,535
We'll both get in trouble
with the Congressman!

487
00:30:28,618 --> 00:30:30,161
You go after him yourself!

488
00:30:30,245 --> 00:30:32,205
I can't believe you lost to Diego!

489
00:30:32,288 --> 00:30:35,166
Go after him and retrieve my money!

490
00:30:36,125 --> 00:30:37,794
Stop staring! Leave!

491
00:30:38,127 --> 00:30:39,170
Now!

492
00:30:41,756 --> 00:30:43,591
-[Sanggano] Let's go!
-[Ivy] Get back my 50 million!

493
00:30:44,175 --> 00:30:45,969
You're useless, Colonel!

494
00:30:47,470 --> 00:30:48,513
Hurry!

495
00:30:53,935 --> 00:30:54,936
[chuckles]

496
00:30:58,773 --> 00:30:59,816
[phone dialing]

497
00:31:00,275 --> 00:31:01,276
Diego.

498
00:31:01,943 --> 00:31:03,653
Take care of the money.

499
00:31:03,862 --> 00:31:05,321
We already secured it.

500
00:31:05,947 --> 00:31:09,158
Julio can never use this for his schemes.

501
00:31:09,242 --> 00:31:11,244
Thanks, Diego. Be careful.

502
00:31:14,205 --> 00:31:15,331
[phone ringing]

503
00:31:17,750 --> 00:31:19,335
-Mom?
-Lily.

504
00:31:19,919 --> 00:31:21,004
Lily, my dear.

505
00:31:21,796 --> 00:31:22,839
Are you safe?!

506
00:31:22,922 --> 00:31:25,049
I heard you and Diego had an encounter

507
00:31:25,133 --> 00:31:27,969
with Ardientes' men. Where are you?!

508
00:31:28,052 --> 00:31:30,471
Mom, don't worry. I'm safe.

509
00:31:30,889 --> 00:31:34,893
I'm just opposite the municipal hall
in Sitio Rabino.

510
00:31:35,310 --> 00:31:37,937
You don't need to pick me up.

511
00:31:39,606 --> 00:31:40,690
Promise me you won't--

512
00:31:40,773 --> 00:31:43,359
[call hangs up]

513
00:31:44,277 --> 00:31:45,236
What's wrong, Miss Camia?

514
00:31:46,112 --> 00:31:50,575
Lily said she's across
from the Sitio Rabino hall.

515
00:31:50,658 --> 00:31:52,201
Do you know where it is?

516
00:31:52,619 --> 00:31:54,370
Yes, I do. I'll take us there.

517
00:32:24,734 --> 00:32:25,860
Diego, it would be better

518
00:32:25,944 --> 00:32:27,987
if we surrender the money to the police.

519
00:32:28,071 --> 00:32:29,614
Leave it to me, Fernan.

520
00:32:29,948 --> 00:32:33,242
What's important is that Julio
can never use this money

521
00:32:33,326 --> 00:32:34,786
in his election scheme.

522
00:32:37,664 --> 00:32:41,834
[tense music playing]

523
00:32:51,678 --> 00:32:54,347
[Damian] You three go there.
You two, that way.

524
00:32:54,722 --> 00:32:55,848
-Yes, boss.
-Move it.

525
00:33:03,189 --> 00:33:06,025
[henchman] Hey, fake Jaguar!
What are you doing here?!

526
00:33:06,484 --> 00:33:08,111
[Damian] Where is the fake Jaguar?

527
00:33:08,403 --> 00:33:09,404
Kill him!

528
00:33:09,487 --> 00:33:10,488
You are.

529
00:33:11,948 --> 00:33:14,325
-Oh, it's me.
-[laughing]

530
00:33:14,409 --> 00:33:15,243
Surrender your gun.

531
00:33:15,326 --> 00:33:17,620
Oh! Don't shoot!

532
00:33:17,704 --> 00:33:18,913
You'll wake everyone up.

533
00:33:18,997 --> 00:33:20,206
-Just surrender your gun?
-[grunts]

534
00:33:21,165 --> 00:33:22,166
[thuds]

535
00:33:26,587 --> 00:33:27,630
[gunshot]

536
00:33:34,887 --> 00:33:35,930
[gunshot]

537
00:33:38,975 --> 00:33:40,184
[gunshots]

538
00:33:44,605 --> 00:33:45,648
[gunshots]

539
00:33:50,653 --> 00:33:52,947
[Damian panting]

540
00:33:57,618 --> 00:33:58,953
[Emilia] Thank God, Jaguar.

541
00:33:59,037 --> 00:34:01,748
I can't believe this! I am finally free!

542
00:34:02,040 --> 00:34:03,708
Free and away from them!

543
00:34:04,125 --> 00:34:05,668
I cannot believe this!

544
00:34:06,335 --> 00:34:09,630
Jaguar, thank you. Thank you so much.

545
00:34:10,923 --> 00:34:11,924
[Raul] Emilia,

546
00:34:13,092 --> 00:34:14,302
no one will hurt you anymore.

547
00:34:14,385 --> 00:34:17,305
I won't let your bastard father
make you cry again.

548
00:34:18,222 --> 00:34:21,559
As long as the Jaguar is around,
no one can hurt you.

549
00:34:22,435 --> 00:34:23,561
Thank you, Jaguar.

550
00:34:24,270 --> 00:34:26,689
You know, I've never felt
so loved in my life.

551
00:34:26,773 --> 00:34:28,858
You're the only one
who made me feel this way.

552
00:34:28,941 --> 00:34:30,151
Thank you very much.

553
00:34:38,367 --> 00:34:39,494
-[line rings]
-Hello?

554
00:34:40,745 --> 00:34:43,831
Yes, this is Clarita de Guzman
of the Ardientes.

555
00:34:47,335 --> 00:34:50,797
Madam, there's something you need to know.

556
00:34:52,131 --> 00:34:54,300
[Julio] And who are you calling?

557
00:34:56,969 --> 00:34:58,387
[tense music playing]

558
00:34:58,471 --> 00:34:59,639
It's none of your business.

559
00:35:00,306 --> 00:35:01,182
[thuds and clatters]

560
00:35:01,265 --> 00:35:02,642
What's wrong with you, Julio?!

561
00:35:02,725 --> 00:35:05,937
You little sneaky rat!

562
00:35:06,479 --> 00:35:08,356
You take me for a fool, huh?!

563
00:35:08,439 --> 00:35:10,566
Do you think I'm stupid?!

564
00:35:11,692 --> 00:35:15,905
I know why you've been enduring
in this family

565
00:35:16,155 --> 00:35:20,493
and why you're staying
despite all the madness!

566
00:35:21,410 --> 00:35:23,621
It's because you're an informant!

567
00:35:25,206 --> 00:35:27,250
Who are you working for?

568
00:35:28,417 --> 00:35:31,212
-Ivy Aguas?!
-[laughing]

569
00:35:32,672 --> 00:35:35,007
You're so vain, Julio!

570
00:35:35,716 --> 00:35:37,176
Did it ever occur to you

571
00:35:37,260 --> 00:35:39,428
that Emilia became corrupt because of you?

572
00:35:39,512 --> 00:35:40,972
Because of this family?!

573
00:35:42,098 --> 00:35:45,017
And don't tell me
that you didn't benefit from it!

574
00:35:46,227 --> 00:35:49,188
All she ever wanted
was to earn your approval!

575
00:35:49,856 --> 00:35:55,319
Well, I did not ask her to commit plunder!

576
00:35:56,779 --> 00:35:59,031
And more importantly,

577
00:35:59,115 --> 00:36:01,826
I did not ask her to get caught!

578
00:36:02,451 --> 00:36:05,496
Whatever happened to Emilia
was her own fault,

579
00:36:05,580 --> 00:36:07,373
so let her rot in jail!

580
00:36:07,456 --> 00:36:10,168
Well, if you aren't going to help Emilia,

581
00:36:10,251 --> 00:36:12,295
you might as well tell her the truth!

582
00:36:15,173 --> 00:36:16,299
The truth?

583
00:36:17,758 --> 00:36:18,885
What is it?

584
00:36:19,635 --> 00:36:22,722
What truth are you talking about, huh?!

585
00:36:24,473 --> 00:36:26,267
-Answer me!
-Hands off me!

586
00:36:26,726 --> 00:36:29,145
If you don't answer properly,

587
00:36:29,228 --> 00:36:32,648
I'll make sure that Emilia
will rot in jail!

588
00:36:32,732 --> 00:36:34,650
Why are you so furious with Emilia?!

589
00:36:35,526 --> 00:36:37,361
Is it because you think of her
as a weak woman?

590
00:36:38,196 --> 00:36:40,281
Or because of her true identity?!

591
00:36:44,118 --> 00:36:46,162
That her real mother is not Esmeralda?!

592
00:36:47,580 --> 00:36:48,581
That, Julio…

593
00:36:48,664 --> 00:36:51,918
That is your biggest secret!

594
00:36:52,001 --> 00:36:53,920
Yes! I admit it!

595
00:36:54,962 --> 00:36:59,133
Esmeralda is not the mother of Emilia.

596
00:37:00,009 --> 00:37:03,554
Your sister just happened to be my wife

597
00:37:03,638 --> 00:37:05,890
but I never loved her!

598
00:37:05,973 --> 00:37:07,808
Is that what you wanted to hear?!

599
00:37:07,892 --> 00:37:09,018
Huh? Is that it?!

600
00:37:09,101 --> 00:37:12,188
That's not the secret
that I'm referring to!

601
00:37:12,271 --> 00:37:16,984
I'm talking about the woman
who tricked you!

602
00:37:17,818 --> 00:37:20,613
Now, do I dare mention her name?

603
00:37:20,696 --> 00:37:21,906
[Julio] Shut the hell up!

604
00:37:22,531 --> 00:37:26,118
You don't mention her name in my house

605
00:37:26,494 --> 00:37:27,995
nor in my presence!

606
00:37:28,079 --> 00:37:32,291
You, the king of this town!

607
00:37:32,375 --> 00:37:37,088
The almighty Julio that
is worshipped by the people…

608
00:37:37,171 --> 00:37:39,048
-Shut up!
-…was played

609
00:37:39,131 --> 00:37:41,884
and tricked by a woman!

610
00:37:41,968 --> 00:37:43,135
The woman that you hated the most!

611
00:37:43,219 --> 00:37:45,763
-The woman you called weak!
-Yes!

612
00:37:46,264 --> 00:37:47,848
I stole our daughter!

613
00:37:49,809 --> 00:37:54,855
I stole Emilia to punish her!

614
00:37:55,690 --> 00:37:58,401
I want our child to experience the pain

615
00:37:58,776 --> 00:38:02,613
that I suffered from her mother!

616
00:38:03,572 --> 00:38:08,744
And to take my revenge
against that filthy woman!

617
00:38:10,454 --> 00:38:12,373
You're a demon, Julio!

618
00:38:14,959 --> 00:38:17,003
I will tell her the truth!

619
00:38:17,086 --> 00:38:19,547
She can help Emilia to get away

620
00:38:19,630 --> 00:38:20,840
from a demon like you!

621
00:38:20,923 --> 00:38:23,426
Go ahead! [laughing]

622
00:38:23,968 --> 00:38:26,846
Go ahead! Let me see you try!

623
00:38:26,929 --> 00:38:31,726
Let's see, if she'll come down
from her pedestal

624
00:38:31,809 --> 00:38:33,019
to help her daughter!

625
00:38:33,728 --> 00:38:37,690
A daughter that she never met!

626
00:38:37,940 --> 00:38:42,486
A daughter that she never loved!

627
00:38:42,570 --> 00:38:44,322
What do you know about love?!

628
00:38:45,114 --> 00:38:46,991
-You have no right to love!
-You witch!

629
00:38:47,074 --> 00:38:49,744
You have no right to be a father

630
00:38:50,619 --> 00:38:53,289
if you can't get Emilia out

631
00:38:53,372 --> 00:38:56,542
of this miserable fate that has been
brought about by your name!

632
00:38:57,585 --> 00:38:58,961
Pathetic old man!

633
00:38:59,462 --> 00:39:02,006
Clarita! Clarita!

634
00:39:02,089 --> 00:39:04,425
[groaning loudly]

635
00:39:06,052 --> 00:39:07,094
Guard!

636
00:39:12,099 --> 00:39:14,352
[Claire] Driver. Driver.

637
00:39:16,520 --> 00:39:17,855
Guard!

638
00:39:18,856 --> 00:39:19,899
[guard] Yes, sir?

639
00:39:20,566 --> 00:39:21,901
Go after Clarita!

640
00:39:21,984 --> 00:39:24,070
Don't let her leave this town!

641
00:39:24,362 --> 00:39:26,072
Shoot her if you have to!

642
00:39:26,155 --> 00:39:28,574
But do not let her leave this place alive!

643
00:39:28,657 --> 00:39:29,909
Go! Go!

644
00:39:30,576 --> 00:39:33,704
Clarita! Run for your life!

645
00:39:34,372 --> 00:39:37,083
[groaning loudly]

646
00:39:38,751 --> 00:39:40,753
[tense music playing]

647
00:40:00,689 --> 00:40:02,900
[engine revving]

648
00:40:11,742 --> 00:40:12,618
-[gunshot]
-[grunts]

649
00:40:26,590 --> 00:40:27,633
[gunshot]

650
00:40:42,398 --> 00:40:46,026
-[goon] Let's go.
-[engine revs]

651
00:41:01,917 --> 00:41:02,918
[mumbling] Emilia.

652
00:41:04,879 --> 00:41:06,797
[coughs and groans]

653
00:41:20,811 --> 00:41:21,854
[Emilia] Wait.

654
00:41:22,146 --> 00:41:23,606
I think that's Aunt Claire.

655
00:41:25,316 --> 00:41:26,150
Stop the car!

656
00:41:27,943 --> 00:41:28,986
That's Aunt Claire!

657
00:41:29,487 --> 00:41:30,696
Oh my God!

658
00:41:31,238 --> 00:41:33,365
Aunt Claire! Auntie!

659
00:41:34,074 --> 00:41:35,576
Oh my God! Auntie!

660
00:41:36,869 --> 00:41:39,205
Who did this to you?! Auntie!

661
00:41:39,747 --> 00:41:41,040
Who shot you?!

662
00:41:41,957 --> 00:41:43,542
Auntie, who did this to you?

663
00:41:44,585 --> 00:41:46,962
Esmeralda is not…

664
00:41:50,299 --> 00:41:52,384
your real mother.

665
00:42:00,851 --> 00:42:02,561
[whimpering] Auntie!

666
00:42:07,066 --> 00:42:08,442
Auntie!

667
00:42:09,068 --> 00:42:10,110
Please don't!

668
00:42:16,033 --> 00:42:19,828
[wailing] Auntie!

669
00:42:31,131 --> 00:42:32,258
[pants]

670
00:42:34,176 --> 00:42:38,973
[panting]

671
00:42:42,434 --> 00:42:43,852
[groaning loudly]

672
00:42:52,111 --> 00:42:53,279
[line ringing]

673
00:42:53,571 --> 00:42:56,156
[phone hangs up]

674
00:42:58,242 --> 00:43:02,162
[gasping slowly]

675
00:43:02,538 --> 00:43:05,332
Miss Camia, we're here.

676
00:43:08,335 --> 00:43:11,046
[gasping]

677
00:43:13,173 --> 00:43:15,050
[suspenseful music playing]

678
00:43:35,571 --> 00:43:37,948
[gasping]

679
00:44:01,597 --> 00:44:02,765
What happened here?

680
00:44:32,795 --> 00:44:34,672
[whimpers] Dante?

681
00:44:38,008 --> 00:44:38,842
Mom?

682
00:44:41,053 --> 00:44:41,970
Dante?

683
00:44:45,474 --> 00:44:46,517
Dante!

684
00:44:50,979 --> 00:44:52,022
Mom!

685
00:45:11,500 --> 00:45:12,543
Dad?

686
00:45:20,717 --> 00:45:22,719
[tense music playing]

687
00:45:26,014 --> 00:45:27,266
<i>Your money is already secured.</i>

688
00:45:27,349 --> 00:45:29,768
<i>It's a good thing that Julio</i>
<i>didn't get his hands on it.</i>

689
00:45:29,852 --> 00:45:31,645
<i>The money isn't important, Diego.</i>

690
00:45:31,728 --> 00:45:33,856
<i>What matters is you're safe.</i>
<i>You're all safe.</i>

691
00:45:33,939 --> 00:45:38,110
<i>Are you sure Miss Aguas</i>
<i>is responsible for this screwup?</i>

692
00:45:38,193 --> 00:45:39,445
<i>I'm sure, Congressman.</i>

693
00:45:39,528 --> 00:45:41,947
<i>We'll make her pay for it.</i>

694
00:45:42,030 --> 00:45:45,659
<i>Make sure to find the location of Emilia.</i>

695
00:45:45,742 --> 00:45:46,618
[Damian] <i>Camia?</i>

696
00:45:46,702 --> 00:45:47,995
<i>I'm sorry, brother.</i>

697
00:45:48,078 --> 00:45:51,248
<i>Looks like I won't just be</i>
<i>reclaiming Jaguar's identity.</i>

698
00:45:51,331 --> 00:45:55,335
<i>I'll be taking Camia's love</i>
<i>from you as well.</i>

699
00:45:56,962 --> 00:45:57,796
<i>Surprised?</i>

700
00:45:57,880 --> 00:46:00,716
[theme music playing]
